  "_readme": [
    "KDL-490 A/B manifest for scripts/brand-inference-ab.mjs (run with a real ANTHROPIC_API_KEY).",
    "Company names are anonymized on purpose: production clients are unknown brands, so real famous",
    "names would leak brand priors into the text-only baseline and understate the image contribution.",
    "Regenerate the logo fixtures (real marks, KDL-482 §1.3 normalization) with:",
    "  for s in starbucks airbnb stripe duolingo headspace; do curl -s -o $s.svg https://cdn.simpleicons.org/$s; done",
    "  then per file: sharp(svg, {density:300}).resize(1024,1024,{fit:'inside',withoutEnlargement:false}).png({compressionLevel:9})",
    "  (sharp is installed in backend/node_modules)"
  ],
